WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.377 --> 00:00:02.790
Welcome to MR_Rokesh Job Portal — an AI-powered job search and application assistant. Let's take a quick tour.

2
00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:02.846
Sign in with your email and password.

3
00:00:02.846 --> 00:00:10.420
Click Sign In to enter your dashboard.

4
00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:14.970
The Dashboard is your job search hub. Search across multiple providers, filter by country, salary and job type, and save jobs you like.

5
00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:19.814
Generate Resume lets you build a resume tailored to a specific job with AI, or use the LaTeX Resume Builder templates.

6
00:00:19.814 --> 00:00:24.655
Generate a matching cover letter from your resume and a job description in a few guided steps.

7
00:00:24.655 --> 00:00:29.551
Analytics tracks your activity — resumes stored, cover letters, jobs applied for, and jobs in your tracker.

8
00:00:29.551 --> 00:00:34.389
Job Tracker keeps every job you save — manually or from the browser extension — in one place.

9
00:00:34.389 --> 00:00:39.227
Connect your own AI provider key here. Keys are stored securely and power resume and cover-letter generation.

10
00:00:39.227 --> 00:00:44.077
These are the values the browser extension uses to auto-fill job applications — fully editable, with control over which fields to skip.

11
00:00:44.077 --> 00:00:48.921
Install the Chrome extension to autofill applications on any job site with a single shortcut.

12
00:00:48.921 --> 00:00:53.765
Personalize the app in Settings — switch between light and dark themes, language, timezone and notifications.

13
00:00:53.765 --> 00:00:59.003
Need help? The Help & Support page has quick links and answers to common questions. Thanks for watching!
